    file: 'services/ml-prediction/src/training/trainer.py',
    effort: '2 hours',
    impact: 'Medium — LightGBM models are trained for the full n_estimators without early stopping, often overfitting compared to XGBoost which has working early stopping.',
    what: 'The LGB trainer passes eval_set and callbacks to fit() using the XGBoost API signature. LightGBM uses a different API (valid_sets, valid_names, callbacks). The params are silently ignored.',
    fix: 'Use LightGBM-specific fit() params: lgb.fit(X_train, y_train, eval_set=[(X_val, y_val)], callbacks=[lgb.early_stopping(50), lgb.log_evaluation(0)]). Validate that early stopping is triggered by logging the best iteration.',
