    what: '_WEIGHTS (technical/momentum/value/growth/volatility/relative_strength) has been a hardcoded guess since this service shipped, never empirically validated against real forward returns. Ranking already stores all 6 individual factor scores per (stock_id, as_of), meaning a sweep can recompute alternative composite scores directly from already-persisted data — no signal regeneration needed, mirroring signal-engine\'s own tune_strategy() no-re-simulation advantage.',
