    what: 'Found while completing the T233-ARCH-INDICATOR-DEDUP rollout (research-engine → ranking-engine → ml-prediction → market-data → signal-engine, riskiest last). Quantified the exact boundary condition (14 vs 15 bars) mathematically before touching any code, then checked production data for how many stocks currently fall in the affected range.',
