    implementedNote: 'Fixed 2026-07-11. Added a _resolve_horizon(req) helper that derives horizon from _HORIZON_BY_STYLE.get(req.style.upper(), req.horizon) — falling back to the request value only for an unrecognized style — and wired it into all three predict endpoints (/predict, /predict_ensemble, /predict_ensemble_three) instead of passing req.horizon straight through. routes.py compiles clean.',
