    impact: 'User asked (2026-07-16, same conversation that shipped Volume Profile/Fixed Range VP) for more entry/exit analysis tools. Anchored VWAP — VWAP recalculated from a user-chosen starting point (an earnings date, a swing low, a big-volume breakout day) rather than the existing VWAP\'s fixed rolling window — is one of the most commonly paired tools with volume-profile-based entries: "is price still above VWAP from the day I would have entered" is a standard trend-continuation check.',
    title: 'DONE 2026-07-19: Anchored VWAP — click a point on the chart, VWAP recalculates forward from that anchor',
