    fix: 'The symbol query now does a GROUP BY per symbol (each symbol occupies exactly one of the top-5 slots regardless of how many horizon rows it has). A per-symbol Redis SET NX EX lock now gates every /trigger POST — even if duplicate rows somehow survived, only the first call within the cooldown window can proceed. trigger_research() now ALSO checks the same in-flight-generation dict generate_research() uses to dedupe concurrent generations, returning already_in_flight instead of scheduling a second duplicate background task — deliberately READ-ONLY (a self-caught near-miss during implementation: a first draft that pre-registered the in-flight entry synchronously would have introduced a real 60-second hang/deadlock, caught by tracing exactly what the background task\'s own re-entrant HTTP call does before shipping). The whole auto-trigger function is now gated behind a new global admin feature flag (auto_research_enabled, default OFF — the only Claude-calling feature in the app with no opt-in/opt-out anywhere despite being the single most expensive model+prompt combination).',
