    what: 'Direct user request: "Review all the docs under recomm_or_audit folder, see if we have most of them implemented. If not, document them and update improvement tracker page for action items. Check the INSTITUTIONAL_FEATURES_OVERVIEW.md first, others are supplementary." Read all 8 docs, then verified each of the 13 features against actual current code (3 parallel verification agents, each required to cite file:line; every high-stakes claim then independently re-checked by hand with targeted greps and a live production DB query).',
