    implementedNote: 'Built 2026-08-20. New test_decide_gameplan_style_float.py (5 cases) — source-text extraction of just the game-plan-resolution block (routes.py/_decide() is directly importable in this test environment, matching test_game_plan_atr_mult.py\'s own established stub list, but _decide() itself is async with too many other dependencies to drive whole — extracted and dedented just the fixed block instead). Covers the exact reported bug (a real "style": "GROWTH" game_plan dict no longer crashes), all 4 real trading styles surviving unconverted, a None value also passing through (float(None) raises TypeError, a different exception than the string case — both must be caught by the same guard), and confirms the fix produces IDENTICAL output to the original behavior for the common, non-buggy case (no style key at all) — this fix must not change anything for calls that never hit the bug. Adversarially verified: reverted to the original blanket-float bug and confirmed all 4 relevant tests failed with the exact real production ValueError, then restored and confirmed byte-identical via diff. Full 239-test decision-engine suite green; pyflakes clean (the one remaining warning, an unused PositionPlan import, confirmed pre-existing via git stash).',
